  "notes": "The noun form {割|わ}り{当|あ}て is very common, especially in business and computing contexts. Also used in IT for assigning addresses, resources, or shortcuts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {役割|やくわり}を{割|わ}り{当|あ}てる — to assign roles\n- {予算|よさん}を{割|わ}り{当|あ}てる — to allocate a budget\n- {時間|じかん}を{割|わ}り{当|あ}てる — to allot time\n- IPアドレスを{割|わ}り{当|あ}てる — to assign an IP address\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {配分|はいぶん}する — to distribute, to apportion (more formal)\n- {振|ふ}り{分|わ}ける — to sort, to distribute",
